# Theory: the simulated provider is log-normal with median 40 ms and p99 250 ms
$ python3 -c "import math; s=math.log(250/40)/2.3263; print(f\"sigma={s:.4f}  theoretical p95 = 40*exp(sigma*1.6449) = {40*math.exp(s*1.6449):.1f} ms\")"
sigma=0.7878  theoretical p95 = 40*exp(sigma*1.6449) = 146.2 ms

